# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""ord(s) - builtin tra ve ma Unicode cua 1 ky tu (F-1, doi xung voi chr()).

`ord("A")` -> 65, `ord("ê")` -> 234 (U+00EA), `ord("ệ")` -> 7887 (U+1EC7).

Trien khai qua Char.ConvertToUtf32(string, 0) (lay codepoint tai index 0,
xu ly dung ca surrogate pair - doi xung voi `chr()` dung
Char.ConvertFromUtf32). Chuoi rong hoac index ngoai pham vi: .NET nem
ArgumentException/ArgumentOutOfRange (on ao, giong `chr()` nem voi input
ngoai pham vi, theo nguyen tac 'sai am tham nguy hiem hon loi on ao').

Chuoi dai > 1 char: lay codepoint tai vi tri 0 (khong chan compile-time,
vi do dai chi biet luc chay) - khac Python (doi dung 1 char) nhung du
cho moi dung hien tai (group astral pair, lay ma bien surrogate...).
"""
from il_dispatch import register_expr_builtin


def push_ord_builtin(args, scope, out, dtype, ctx):
    if len(args) != 1:
        raise SyntaxError("il_codegen: ord() chi nhan dung 1 tham so")
    ctx['compile_expr'](args[0], scope, out, 'str', ctx)
    out.append('    ldc.i4.0')
    out.append('    call int32 [mscorlib]System.Char::ConvertToUtf32(string, int32)')


register_expr_builtin('ord', push_ord_builtin, 'i32')
